# Bale adapter — AI agent rules

## Read first

For Bale support / inbox / messaging tasks, read in order:

1. `.ai/startup.md`
2. `.ai/capabilities/README.md`
3. Relevant `.ai/design/` and `.ai/capabilities/` docs

End sessions with `.ai/shutdown.md`.

## Protected paths — DO NOT EDIT

**`.ai/architecture/**`** is human-maintained. AI agents must not modify any file in this folder. Read only.

## AI-maintained docs

Update `.ai/design/` when implementation behavior changes. Keep files short.

## Never

- Ask for OTP or read `.session/session.bale`
- Commit `data/`, `.session/`, or `.env`
- Auto-send Bale messages without human approval (`--dry-run` first)
